    <decisions>
        <description>When there is an assignment from Group to Agent, checks if owner id was a group and if yes, updates the Last Queue Owner field to OwnerId of case .</description>
        <name>Is_OwnerId_of_Case_is_Group</name>
        <label>Is OwnerId of Case is Group</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Route_work_to_desired_Agent</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Case_Owner_is_Group</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Case_Record.OwnerId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>StartsWith</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>00G</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Case_Record</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Case Owner is Group</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>This flow helps supervisor to transfer the case manually from Queue to agent and agent to agent via &apos;Transfer Button&apos;.
When there is an assignment from Group to Agent, updates the Last Queue Owner field to OwnerId of case because, manual reassignment is not populating &apos;OriginalGroupID&apos; field in AgentWork record.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
